            "A02:2021-Cryptographic Failures": [261, 296, 310, 319, 321, 322, 323, 324, 325, 326, 327, 328, 329, 330, 331, 335, 336, 337, 338, 340, 347, 523, 720, 757, 759, 760, 780, 818, 916],
